<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hannaford is Focus One.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hannaford is Focus One.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it named Hanniford Brothers Co its Focus One stock of the week, upgrading the stock to a near-term buy from accumulate. The stock remains a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/2 to 33-3/4.</p>
